This license applies to the source code, configuration files, documentation, and other original content in this repository for which the YGOPro3 project authors and contributors own the copyright.
This license does not apply to materials, trademarks, music, fonts, images, game assets, or other content that are listed in "Third-Party Materials and Reservation of Rights" below or that can reasonably be identified as third-party property.

