Subject to your compliance with all terms of this license, the copyright holders grant you a free, non-exclusive, non-transferable, and non-sublicensable license to:

1. obtain, read, build, and run this project;
2. copy this project for personal learning, research, backup, debugging, or personal-use purposes;
3. modify this project for personal-use purposes;
4. use modified versions on your own devices or in private environments, provided that you do not publicly publish or publicly distribute release packages of modified versions.

### 2. Restrictions

Without prior written permission from the copyright holders, you may not:

1. use this project or any modified version for commercial purposes;
2. sell, rent, provide for a fee, bundle for sale, or otherwise directly or indirectly profit from this project, modified versions, build artifacts, or related services;
3. use this project or any modified version in commercial products, commercial services, advertising, promotion, paid communities, paid downloads, commercial competitions, or any other profit-making scenario;
4. publicly publish installation packages, archives, update packages, or binary artifacts of modified or repackaged versions through social media;
5. remove, hide, or alter this license, copyright notices, author attribution, third-party material source notices, or existing acknowledgements in the project;
6. claim copyright ownership over this project, third-party materials, Yu-Gi-Oh!-related materials, music, fonts, or any other content that is not your original work;
7. imply in any way that this project is officially authorized, approved, sponsored, endorsed, or affiliated with KONAMI, Yu-Gi-Oh! Master Duel, third-party material rights holders, or any other source party, unless you have obtained the corresponding written permission.

### 3. Permitted Modifications and Forks

You may fork, copy, or modify this project, but only for learning, communication, and research between yourself and your friends.

If you wish to publicly publish modifications, you should preferably contribute them to the original project by submitting an issue, patch, or pull request. Whether such contributions are accepted, merged, or published is determined by the maintainers of the original project.

### 4. Third-Party Materials and Reservation of Rights

This project may contain or reference third-party materials that are not owned by the YGOPro3 project authors or contributors. Such materials are not licensed under this license, and all related rights are reserved by their original rights holders.

1. Some image assets, fonts, or related visual assets originate from unpacked content of the game *Yu-Gi-Oh! Master Duel*. The related rights belong to their respective rights holders. This project does not grant you any right to use, copy, modify, distribute, or commercially exploit those materials.
2. Rock-paper-scissors related images come from the [Internet](https://www.tukuppt.com/muban/aebypkbz.html), and the source site states that commercial use is not allowed. The related rights belong to their original rights holders. You may not use those images for commercial purposes or beyond the scope permitted by the original source.
3. Music resources come from the Bilibili uploader [乌鸦Producer](https://b23.tv/STgl276). The copyright and related rights in the musical works belong to their rights holders. This project does not grant you any right to sublicense, publicly communicate, commercially use, or otherwise use those music resources beyond the scope permitted by the original rights holders.

If you use, copy, modify, build, or distribute this project, you are responsible for independently confirming the authorization status of third-party materials and for bearing all responsibility arising from your use of such materials.
